Modified by ogadra: replace the copy mode's vi keys with Emacs keys and start character, line, and rectangle selections with C-SPC, C-l, and C-k, switch the kind around the same anchor when another selection key is pressed and clear it when the same key is pressed again, show the selection kind as CHAR, LINE, or RECT in the mode bar, repeat the last search when C-s or C-r is pressed on an empty search prompt, and read a rectangle selection through the rectangle flag that pane.selection.read now accepts. Applied to herdr v0.9.5 (Apache-2.0).

